v class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Downside</p><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-secondary/80 bg-financial-accent/10 text-financial-accent text-[10px]">NAV</div></div><p class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-destructive">-22.95%</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">₹20,03,404 <span class="opacity-70">(₹-5,96,596)</span></p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">A normal bad year — a correction without a systemic crisis.</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Ongoing SIP of ₹55,000/month replaces the fall in about 11 month(s) of contributions, before any market rebound.</p><p class="text-xs text-financial-gold">Nearest essential goal is 8 years away, which leaves room for a recovery.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Upside</p><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-secondary/80 bg-financial-accent/10 text-financial-accent text-[10px]">NAV</div></div><p class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-foreground">+34.96%</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">₹35,08,908 <span class="opacity-70">(+₹9,08,908)</span></p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">A strong year, of the kind that follows a recovery.</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">No recovery needed in this scenario.</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Severe drawdown</p><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-secondary/80 bg-financial-accent/10 text-financial-accent text-[10px]">NAV</div></div><p class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-destructive">-38.96%</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">₹15,86,988 <span class="opacity-70">(₹-10,13,012)</span></p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">A 2008/2020-style shock measured peak to trough.</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Ongoing SIP of ₹55,000/month replaces the fall in about 19 month(s) of contributions, before any market rebound.</p><p class="text-xs text-financial-gold">Nearest essential goal is 8 years away, which leaves room for a recovery.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border overflow-x-auto"><div class="relative w-full overflow-auto"><table class="w-full caption-bottom text-sm"><thead class="[&amp;_tr]:border-b"><tr class="border-b transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted"><th class="h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0">Asset class</th><th class="h-12 px-4 align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right">Weight</th><th class="h-12 px-4 align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right">Base</th><th class="h-12 px-4 align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right">Downside</th><th class="h-12 px-4 align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right">Upside</th><th class="h-12 px-4 align-middle font-medium text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right">Severe drawdown</th></tr></thead><tbody class="[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0"><tr class="border-b transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:b