ient's annual income on step 1 (Client).</em></li><li class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">• Beta Small Cap Fund: missing purchase date — holding period and gain cannot be computed. <em>Fix: Complete the holding row on step 5 (Portfolio &amp; SIP).</em></li><li class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">• No usable NAV history for 4 of 4 holding(s): Alpha Flexi Cap Fund, Beta Small Cap Fund, Gamma Short Duration Fund, Delta Gold ETF FoF. <em>Fix: Add the AMFI scheme code for each holding, then refresh NAV data.</em></li></ul><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Tax figures below stay visible for review, but no exit is recommended and no verdict can be acted on.</p></div></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4"><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Equity LTCG exemption left this year</p><p class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-foreground">₹1,25,000</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4"><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Tax if every flagged switch is executed now</p><p class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-foreground">₹23,400</p></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4"><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Switch candidates raised by the engine</p><p class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-foreground">1</p></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="rounded-lg border border-border p-4 space-y-2"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-2"><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Beta Small Cap Fund</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Amount considered ₹3,00,000</p></div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-secondary/80 bg-destructive/10 text-destructive gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" 