e [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-muted-foreground">Non-equity (slab)</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right text-muted-foreground">31 mo</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right text-foreground">₹30,000</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right text-muted-foreground">25%</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right"><span class="text-foreground">₹7,800</span></td></tr><tr class="border-b transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-muted"><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium text-foreground">Delta Gold ETF FoF</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-muted-foreground">Special rate asset</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right text-muted-foreground">14 mo</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right text-foreground">₹50,000</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right text-muted-foreground">12.5%</td><td class="p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-right"><span class="text-foreground">₹6,500</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="space-y-1"><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">• Rates are FY 2025-26 statutory rates; surcharge on high total income is not modelled.</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">• Marginal slab is derived from the captured annual income under the new regime.</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">• The ₹1.25L equity LTCG exemption is applied once across the whole portfolio, in the order shown.</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">• Exit load and stamp duty are not included — check the scheme document before executing.</p><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Tax position computed 15/8/2026, 6:55:47 pm.</p></div></div></div>"`;

